WEBVTT

00:00:03.151 --> 00:00:04.433
Your whole H2F program.

00:00:04.453 --> 00:00:05.623
In your pocket.

00:00:05.854 --> 00:00:07.814
Get your access code from your leader.

00:00:08.508 --> 00:00:10.978
Add H2F Trainer to your Home Screen.

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:12.951
Then start every day on Today.

00:00:13.463 --> 00:00:14.763
Plan it. Train it.

00:00:14.916 --> 00:00:16.616
Select your workout format.

00:00:16.968 --> 00:00:18.498
Working reps and sets.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.310
Choose your stations.

00:00:20.823 --> 00:00:22.503
Or build a circuit routine.

00:00:23.702 --> 00:00:25.642
300 plus exercises.

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.300
Too hard? Make it easier.

00:00:28.509 --> 00:00:30.149
Too easy? Make it harder.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.280
Add your own, and share it.

00:00:37.545 --> 00:00:39.015
Hurt? Tap where it hurts.

00:00:39.796 --> 00:00:41.528
Set your injury, pain, and phase.

00:00:41.548 --> 00:00:42.668
Calm it down.

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:43.850
Rebuild.

00:00:44.152 --> 00:00:45.532
Return to training.

00:00:46.104 --> 00:00:48.444
Get a Monday to Friday recovery week.

00:00:49.358 --> 00:00:51.658
Pain too high? See a provider first.

00:00:51.961 --> 00:00:54.191
Sleep. Aim for 7 to 9 hours.

00:00:54.211 --> 00:00:57.798
Set your wake-up time, and it plans your bedtime in sleep cycles.

00:00:57.818 --> 00:01:00.348
Fuel. Your plate matches the day's training.

00:01:00.368 --> 00:01:02.498
Track water, protein, and calories.

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:05.806
Mind. A two-minute daily check-in.

00:01:05.826 --> 00:01:08.596
Three good things, and breathing drills for stress.

00:01:09.533 --> 00:01:11.713
Spirit. Name your top three values.

00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:14.563
Keep a journal, and live one value each week.

00:01:16.040 --> 00:01:18.440
Leaders: see your squad. Send the plan.

00:01:20.246 --> 00:01:23.606
Earn 109 ribbons, across nine areas.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.430
Earn them again for bronze and silver stars.

00:01:27.104 --> 00:01:28.384
H2F Trainer.

00:01:28.404 --> 00:01:30.514
Plan it. Train it. Recover. Repeat.
